(7775657, 1292515, 4008, '<td valign="top">
I like the surfer against the backdrop of the big city. Nice perspective. But in such a landscape the horizon should be horizontal IMO.</td>', 'I like the surfer against the backdrop of the big city. Nice perspective. But in such a landscape the horizon should be horizontal IMO.', '2025-01-27 09:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7775658, 1292645, 4008, '<td valign="top">
Nice city lights landscape. But in such an image with lots of symmetry/balance the crucial lines should straight. I am not saying it needs full perspective correction but currently the middle tower is leaning to the left. Just rotating does not do it because the nearby street then also rotates. I tried it and applied some slight transformation by pulling top right to the right and bottom left to the left. IMO it looks much better then.</td>', 'Nice city lights landscape. But in such an image with lots of symmetry/balance the crucial lines should straight. I am not saying it needs full perspective correction but currently the middle tower is leaning to the left. Just rotating does not do it because the nearby street then also rotates. I tried it and applied some slight transformation by pulling top right to the right and bottom left to the left. IMO it looks much better then.', '2025-01-27 09:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7775659, 1292601, 4008, '<td valign="top">
